#: src/configuration.md:21
msgid "The whole file"
msgstr "ファイル全体"

#: src/configuration.md:23
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"schema = 1\n"
"\n"
"[deck]\n"
"title = \"Chelamon Architecture\"\n"
"author = \"Junta Goto\"\n"
"lang = \"en\"\n"
"\n"
"[canvas]\n"
"width = 1280\n"
"height = 720\n"
"safe_area = [56, 64, 56, 64]     # top, right, bottom, left\n"
"\n"
"[theme]\n"
"styles = [\"design/tokens.css\", \"design/theme.css\", "
"\"design/overrides.css\"]\n"
"\n"
"[components]\n"
"entry = \"components/index.js\"\n"
"\n"
"[tailwind]\n"
"entry = \"design/tailwind.css\"\n"
"preflight = true\n"
"\n"
"[server]\n"
"host = \"127.0.0.1\"\n"
"port = 0                         # 0 asks the OS for a free port\n"
"open = \"presenter\"               # none | index | present | presenter | "
"print\n"
"hot_reload = true\n"
"preload = 1                      # neighbouring slides kept warm\n"
"\n"
"[animation]\n"
"engine = \"animejs\"               # animejs | none\n"
"reduced_motion = \"instant\"       # instant | respect | ignore\n"
"\n"
"[browser]\n"
"command = \"chromium\"\n"
"headless = true\n"
"sandbox = true\n"
"\n"
"[check]\n"
"on_save = \"changed\"              # off | changed | all\n"
"timeout_ms = 10_000\n"
"min_font_px = 18\n"
"overflow_tolerance_px = 1\n"
"max_characters = 900\n"
"external_network = \"deny\"        # deny | allow\n"
"\n"
"[check.rules]\n"
"slide_overflow = \"error\"\n"
"outside_safe_area = \"warning\"\n"
"# … every rule takes error | warning | off\n"
"\n"
"[check.ignore]\n"
"selectors = [\".background-decoration\"]\n"
"slides = [\"appendix\"]\n"
"\n"
"[print]\n"
"route = \"/print\"\n"
"steps = \"final\"                  # final | initial | each\n"
"preflight = true\n"
"show_notes = false\n"
"\n"
"[build]\n"
"output_dir = \"dist\"\n"
"base_url = \"/\"                   # must start and end with '/'\n"
"fingerprint_assets = true\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/configuration.md:91
msgid "Notes on individual settings"
msgstr "個別の設定について"

#: src/configuration.md:93
msgid "canvas"
msgstr "canvas"

#: src/configuration.md:95
msgid ""
"`width` and `height` are the logical size every slide is laid out on; the "
"shell scales it. `safe_area` is the margin the `outside_safe_area` check "
"enforces — content outside it may be clipped by an unfamiliar projector."
msgstr "`width` と `height` は全スライドがレイアウトされる論理サイズで、拡大縮小はシェルが行います。`safe_area` は `outside_safe_area` 検査が守らせる余白です。ここを超えた内容は、初めて使うプロジェクタで切れる可能性があります。"

#: src/configuration.md:99
msgid "browser"
msgstr "browser"

#: src/configuration.md:101
msgid ""
"`command` is resolved the way a shell would: an absolute path is used as "
"given, a bare name is looked up in `PATH`."
msgstr "`command` はシェルと同じ方法で解決されます。絶対パスはそのまま使われ、名前だけなら `PATH` から探します。"

#: src/configuration.md:104
msgid ""
"`sandbox = false` is the documented workaround for Ubuntu 23.10+, most "
"container images and CI runners, where unprivileged user namespaces are "
"restricted and Chromium aborts with \"No usable sandbox\". Everything deck "
"opens is localhost."
msgstr "`sandbox = false` は Ubuntu 23.10 以降、多くのコンテナイメージ、CI ランナーのための正式な回避策です。これらの環境では非特権ユーザー名前空間が制限されており、Chromium が「No usable sandbox」で停止します。deck が開くものはすべて localhost です。"

#: src/configuration.md:108
msgid "tailwind"
msgstr "tailwind"

#: src/configuration.md:110
msgid ""
"`preflight` puts Tailwind's reset at the head of the entry, in `@layer base` "
"— below the deck design system, so it normalises the document without "
"overriding components. Turn it off if you would rather rely on deck's own "
"reset alone."
msgstr "`preflight` は Tailwind のリセットをエントリの先頭、`@layer base` に置きます。deck のデザインシステムより下のレイヤーなので、コンポーネントを上書きせずに文書を正規化します。deck 自身のリセットだけに任せたい場合は無効にしてください。"

#: src/configuration.md:114 src/cli.md:76
msgid "check"
msgstr "check"

#: src/configuration.md:116
msgid ""
"`on_save` reserves the behaviour for editor integrations; `deck check "
"--changed` is the command-line equivalent, comparing content hashes recorded "
"under `.deck/cache/`."
msgstr "`on_save` はエディタ統合のための予約設定です。コマンドラインでの同等物は `deck check --changed` で、`.deck/cache/` に記録した内容ハッシュと比較します。"

#: src/configuration.md:119
msgid ""
"`external_network = \"deny\"` reports any request that leaves the local "
"origin. A deck should not need the network while you present."
msgstr "`external_network = \"deny\"` はローカルオリジンを出るリクエストをすべて報告します。発表中のデッキがネットワークを必要とすべきではありません。"

